('PRS02','PRS · February 2026 monthly policy review','https://prsindia.org/files/policy/policy_annual_policy_review/Monthly%20Policy%20Review/2026-02-01/MPR-Feb_2026.pdf','PDF chunks0–4 read, covering substantive review and opening references; final reference chunk not read. Main HTML fetch failed; guessed -1 route was a 404 and is not evidence.'),
('BUD','Union Budget 2026–27 · Finance Minister speech','https://static.pib.gov.in/WriteReadData/specificdocs/documents/2026/feb/doc202621775901.pdf','PDF chunks0–1 of7 read: introduction and manufacturing/MSME/capex/CCUS/CER proposals. Later tax schedules and complete speech not independently read.'),
('GDP','MoSPI · New GDP series press note, 27 February','https://static.pib.gov.in/WriteReadData/specificdocs/documents/2026/feb/doc2026227806501.pdf','Opening chunk0 of9 inspected: release date, methodological changes and growth highlights. Detailed later national-accounts tables/back-series documents not fully reviewed.'),
('CPI','MoSPI/PIB · CPI2024 first release, 12 February','https://www.pib.gov.in/PressReleasePage.aspx?PRID=2227012&reg=3&lang=1','Chunk0 of11 read: introductory methodology, January provisional national figures, old-series December final figures and response notes. Later detailed tables/technical annexes not fully read; inherited FAQ access recorded separately.'),
('FC','Finance Ministry · Action taken on XVI Finance Commission','https://www.indiabudget.gov.in/doc/16fc.pdf','Both text chunks/full explanatory memorandum read. Distinguishes accepted recommendations, in-principle acceptance, and items for later examination; not a full reading of both Commission report volumes.'),
