('RECOG','PIB · Revised startup recognition, 5 February','https://www.pib.gov.in/PressReleasePage.aspx?PRID=2224069&reg=3&lang=1','Full substantive release in chunk0 of2 read: turnover/deep-tech criteria and cooperative inclusion. Gazette/recognition application rules not independently read.'),
